docs
# The documentation site is a root workspace, so every frozen Bun install needs its manifest
# (.github/scripts/check-bun-workspace-manifests.sh).
!docs/site/package.json
# skills/ ships inside the worker image's two plugin tarballs: scripts/pi-plugin-prepack.sh stages
# each plugin's own skill directories, and nothing else of skills/, so its AGENTS.md is a checkout
# document the build never reads and no image trigger owes.
skills/AGENTS.md

# Envoy: test files and deploy tooling not needed in the image.
packages/envoy/**/*_test.go
packages/envoy/internal/integration/
packages/envoy/internal/smoke/
packages/envoy/deploy/
